{"title":"사막의 여왕 사자의 아내 [19세 완전판]","thumbnail":null,"synopsis":"※본 작품은 동인지입니다.\n“선택해. 백성들과 함께 노예가 될지… 날 받아들여 새로운 사막의 여왕이 될지.”\n사막의 나라 제1왕녀 '네로'는 왕궁을 함락시킨 반란군 레굴루스를 남편으로 맞이한다.\n노예와도 다를 바 없는 괴로운 생활에 지쳤던 네로였지만,\n레굴루스의 진실한 마음에 점차 마음을 열어간다.\n그러다 성안의 뒤틀린 인간관계와 왕가가 저질러온 죄악을 알게 되는데…!","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-09-09","rank":190,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-10","rank":232,"change":{"type":"down","amount":42}},{"date":"2026-09-11","rank":295,"change":{"type":"down","amount":63}}],"weekly":[{"date":"2026-09-14","rank":296,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-15","rank":269,"change":{"type":"up","amount":27}}],"monthly":[]},"viewSeries":[],"metricsSeries":[{"date":"2026-10-11","v":22820,"rc":27,"rs":189,"cc":8},{"date":"2026-10-12","v":23082,"rc":27,"rs":189,"cc":8},{"date":"2026-10-13","v":23340,"rc":27,"rs":189,"cc":8},{"date":"2026-10-14","v":23602,"rc":27,"rs":189,"cc":8},{"date":"2026-10-15","v":23870,"rc":28,"rs":199,"cc":8},{"date":"2026-10-16","v":24205,"rc":28,"rs":199,"cc":8},{"date":"2026-10-17","v":24540,"rc":30,"rs":219,"cc":8},{"date":"2026-10-18","v":24789,"rc":30,"rs":219,"cc":8},{"date":"2026-10-19","v":25058,"rc":30,"rs":219,"cc":8},{"date":"2026-10-20","v":25368,"rc":33,"rs":249,"cc":8},{"date":"2026-10-21","v":25562,"rc":33,"rs":249,"cc":8},{"date":"2026-10-22","v":25780,"rc":33,"rs":249,"cc":8},{"date":"2026-10-23","v":26039,"rc":33,"rs":249,"cc":8},{"date":"2026-10-24","v":26406,"rc":33,"rs":249,"cc":8}]}